{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A NEW TAKE ON GOLF\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge up your boosters to launch Bogey through a wide world filled with unique platforming challenges. Careful, you\u2019ll need good timing and a keen eye to master these diabolical obstacles.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/9cc76e141a1f5202ae93ef89bc159538.avif?t=1772141879\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras_big/9cc76e141a1f5202ae93ef89bc159538.webp?t=1772141879 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE WORLD </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple biomes hide both secrets and a wide variety of mechanics for you to play with and master. Revisit old areas with new powers to unlock additional challenges and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/34eef54cb5029b7772e8a137954ec75b.avif?t=1772141879\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras_big/34eef54cb5029b7772e8a137954ec75b.webp?t=1772141879 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK NEW ABILITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the world four different dungeons hide four unique abilities to control Bogey. Slam in a completely different direction off a bounce pad or skip across water with speed. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/93929d909741729889a46d0505ef7d22.avif?t=1772141879\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras_big/93929d909741729889a46d0505ef7d22.webp?t=1772141879 width=1560 